<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '20px 70px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4, letterSpacing: 1 }}>07 / 试卷与生涯</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 32, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 700, lineHeight: 1.3 }}>一键生成试卷的五步流程</Text></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', padding: '7px 16px', borderRadius: 20, background: '#1E7BE0' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 600 }}>设计中</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 532, paddingTop: 8, flexDirection: 'column' }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center', gap: 18 }}><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16, flex: 1, justifyContent: 'center' }}><svg width={1140} height={290} viewBox='0 0 1140 290'><rect x='0' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='0' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='26' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='26' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>1</text><text x='106.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>读模板与提示词</text><text x='106.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>明确目标</text><path d='M214 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M228 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='231' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='231' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='257' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='257' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>2</text><text x='337.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>整卷目标分配到各题位</text><text x='337.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>避免整体偏离</text><path d='M445 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M459 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='462' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='462' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='488' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='488' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>3</text><text x='568.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>选取 / 生成候选题</text><text x='568.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>复用单题校验</text><path d='M676 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M690 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='693' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='693' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='719' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='719' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>4</text><text x='799.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>汇总整卷覆盖与难度</text><text x='799.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>按同一模板检查</text><path d='M907 105 l14 0' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='2'/><path d='M921 105 l-7 -5 l0 10 z' fill='#1E7BE0'/><rect x='924' y='30' width='213' height='150' rx='8' fill='#FFFFFF' stroke='#1E7BE0' stroke-width='1.5'/><rect x='924' y='30' width='213' height='6' rx='3' fill='#0E2340'/><circle cx='950' cy='66' r='16' fill='#1E7BE0'/><text x='950' y='72' font-size='16' fill='#FFFFFF' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='700'>5</text><text x='1030.5' y='116' font-size='18' fill='#0E2340' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>输出三类产物</text><text x='1030.5' y='146' font-size='14' fill='#7A8699' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='400'>用卷 / 答案解析 / 符合情况</text><path d='M40 200 L1100 200' stroke='#00A9B5' stroke-width='2' stroke-dasharray='5 5'/><path d='M40 200 l10 -6 l0 12 z' fill='#00A9B5'/><text x='570.0' y='226' font-size='15' fill='#00A9B5' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>阶段之间可回退：变式暴露某步不会 → 返回该步训练</text></svg></Box><Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', background: '#F5F7FA', borderLeft: '4px solid #00A9B5', borderRadius: 6, padding: '14px 20px' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#0E2340', fontWeight: 600, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>单题能够解出，是整卷生成的基础条件；整张卷仍需检查覆盖、结构与难度是否符合模板</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center', borderTop: '1px solid #E3E8EF', marginTop: 8 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 13, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}>依据：试卷与生涯维度设计思路.md §4</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#7A8699', fontWeight: 400, lineHeight: 1.4 }}> 69 / 124 </Text></Box></Slide>